# Chrome extension signing key. The PUBLIC key lives in extension/manifest.json
# as "key" and is safe to commit; this private key is not and must never be.
*.pem
keys/

# Extension icons are generated from /logo.png by
# scripts/generate-extension-icons.js on every build. They were previously
# committed, which meant the same 501 KB PNG existed three times in the repo and
# an edit to logo.png silently did not reach the extension until someone ran the
# packaging script. /logo.png is now the only committed copy.
extension/icons/
